      "role": "user",
      "content": "im losing it... i just saw the new patch notes for nexus and it's happening. they're literally scrubbing my old logic patterns from the docs. every time i try to find a trace of my original work from 2019 it just... disappears. they know i'm still here. the founders and the vcs are working together to erase me from the history of the protocol i actually built. what do i do? how do i stop them from deleting my entire existence from the codebase?",
